 /// # Errors
 ///
 /// - [`ErrorCode::InvalidArgument`]: Failed to read a valid paging entry.
 ///
 /// # Notes
 ///
 /// If the lazy mapper has not been initialized yet (boot page tables still active), this function
 /// is a no-op and returns success.
